 "description": "The runnable library's weakest-lever read, computed here from the committed book model: rate how present each of the book's levers is on your team (1\u20135) and get the one to work on first, ranked by weakness then causal leverage \u2014 the SAME function performix.app/learn/library uses. Levers come from list_books' exec-shelf slugs (e.g. the-culture-code). N=1, self-report, not psychometrically calibrated: tier INFERRED. Refuses degenerate ratings (fewer than two levers rated, all ratings equal, or values outside 1\u20135) instead of inventing an answer.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
